   \]

5. **Relative‑speed factor**  
   \[
   \sqrt{\frac{8k_B T}{\pi\mu}}
   = \sqrt{\frac{8(1.381\times10^{-23}\,\text{J K}^{-1})(666.85\ \text{K})}
